{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45594","headline":"经古战场 · 贯休","name":"经古战场","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茫茫凶荒，迥如天设。\n驻马四顾，气候迂结。\n秋空峥嵘，黄日将没。\n多少行人，白日见物。\n莫道路高低，尽是战骨。\n莫见地赤碧，尽是征血。\n昔人昔人既能忠尽于力，身糜戈戟。\n脂其风，膏其域。\n今人何不绳其塍？\n植其食。\n而使空旷年年，常贮愁烟。\n使我至此，不能无言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}